{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "25a3e1af65b380c1f2a10f89849c04e87efcda40c454619a4c6339ef5af80020", "ja": "『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』もついに最終回\nの収録。子ども達とのお別れを悲しむアイド\nル達だったが、プロデューサーは子ども達を\n劇場に招待することを提案する。アイドル達\nは最後も元気いっぱいに挨拶を響かせる。", "zh": "《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》要拍最后一集了。\n偶像们因为要和小朋友道别而依依不舍，\n制作人见状便提议邀请孩子们来剧场。\n偶像们直到最后依然活力充沛地\n高呼口号。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "31370d97eb22e7c0712c5f7f806f198fc243932d32d71a8791ba742a8d8a3dcc", "ja": "やったよぉ！\n地球のお友達のおかげで、宇宙船がなおったべさ！", "zh": "太棒了！\n多亏有地球上的朋友，我们修好了太空船哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "99e7457dd7549f434c9322434e72259b2f83853f968af2e3ddcffdc1f5b305bb", "ja": "よーし、さっそく反重力機関、スイッチオン！", "zh": "很好～那就赶快来启动反重力装置吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "3743e2a002550399479a71627a766ff96f37fd7f5db7521ba056a775754881f2", "ja": "わああ、動いたぞーっ！\nこれでミリオン星に帰れるね！", "zh": "哇啊啊，动起来了──！\n这样就可以回百万行星了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "a65cdf02547e629d25414e9c8605e4b5b49f15ceed246c25682b9bce0516936f", "ja": "地球のみんなも、せんのーできたよね！", "zh": "而且我们也已经把地球上的人都洗脑了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "0334fd6cfe0b016bbe261d0b37859c182ed3e3ffda2da501c5318d38b633d918", "ja": "それじゃあ、これで……。", "zh": "那么，这样就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "cdd6d74e14d0981cb2df81828b4d924d70777d8f2c704633f753dd11ee286130", "ja": "せーふく、かんりょー！！", "zh": "征服，完成──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "cdd6d74e14d0981cb2df81828b4d924d70777d8f2c704633f753dd11ee286130", "ja": "せーふく、かんりょー！！", "zh": "征服，完成──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "cdd6d74e14d0981cb2df81828b4d924d70777d8f2c704633f753dd11ee286130", "ja": "せーふく、かんりょー！！", "zh": "征服，完成──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "cdd6d74e14d0981cb2df81828b4d924d70777d8f2c704633f753dd11ee286130", "ja": "せーふく、かんりょー！！", "zh": "征服，完成──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "34bdacc00453011961f2bd8cc9d8cc8805f2a05c18eb3030a03f486b71c86f20", "ja": "最終回リハーサルも、ばっちりだったぞ！\n1クール……あっという間だったな。", "zh": "最后一集的排练也很顺利喔！\n三个月……真是一转眼就过去了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "e4635a5b00ed3a3c5305a93c97e75e27f6d58d7cb10175df2bfb9ae7823439bd", "ja": "これでミリオン星人のみんなも、\nおうちに帰れるんですね。よかったです♪", "zh": "这样各位百万星人也可以\n回到自己的家了呢，真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "ec2ec01362f7c45b431b1ceea26c54456fa1755d3e9e99aa17ae79d0496478bf", "ja": "みんなようやく、生まれた星に帰って、\nお父さんやお母さんに会えるんだねぇ。", "zh": "大家终于可以回到出生的星球，\n见到爸爸妈妈了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "b0fa04fb579c09a83292276dd78cf82d911e2aef7940047cbccb815fd371b76e", "ja": "久しぶりにふるさとの友達や家族に会ったら、\nどんな気持ちになるんだろうか。", "zh": "久违地见到故乡的亲朋好友时，\n到底会是什么样的心情呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "15b8d1eedcb510bd723ef9a0734f34c55b166a2426b48e06ff533f8150e616e4", "ja": "（ひなたの故郷も遠いところだ。\n簡単には帰れないんだよな……）", "zh": "（日向的故乡也在很远的地方，\n没办法想回去就回去呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "1391463fb2d77b28f0e4d33417b8bca5c3f7d6d74bf03676a1ac7ab928275d15", "ja": "けど、これで子ども達ともお別れなんだねぇ。\n短い間だったけど、なまら寂しいべさ。", "zh": "不过，这下我们也要和小朋友道别了呢～\n虽然相处的时间不长，但还是特寂寞的哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "dd891c3155a016f8b3ceca65b01b47734b784a59ce9753b42f16eb8666977a37", "ja": "あ……。番組が終わったら、\nあの子たちとは、もう……？", "zh": "啊……要是节目播完，\n以后就见不到那些孩子了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "e73bc11a338ee589699109df9868a5899c80d7824dc50b8b7a75c6146a592c83", "ja": "あーっ、そうだった！\nうう、せっかくお友達になれたのに……。", "zh": "啊──对耶！\n呜呜，大家好不容易才成为朋友的说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "57988620700c6b0dceb6d40eafefc40d5ca4ed352600bc554e1e49fec02c89b1", "ja": "なんだか……本当の家族と、\nお別れする時みたいな感じがするよ。", "zh": "我总觉得……现在的心情就跟\n和真正的家人分开时一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "a565d9d4ac41e889a4f446976bd8bccca4d1884e3b8c839f7a98ac7ebbd45c2b", "ja": "ばあちゃんなら、電話で話せたりもできるけど。\nあの子達とはもう……、会えないんかなぁ？", "zh": "虽然我和奶奶还可以讲电话聊天，\n但我们跟那些小朋友……以后就再也见不到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "6c6657246235f64a4621c458ac8e29866dece7172888975890c6279b8d2edbcb", "ja": "うう……。", "zh": "呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "ab0a0c357aa5c51c9ec698a00405901ff2fb11e310fdb82550e51ca7b1804fe4", "ja": "くすん……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "8af9af793d82095b945d8650922e4b99dc60f1291eeac55768b23de287951198", "ja": "ぐすっ……", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a4dbc8c509b5d40684248c5baa9706e5c1c278fb5e68ece006b5e1dc6cc901ad", "ja": "いや、そんなことはないよ。", "zh": "不，没这回事啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "81e02799f0237c69c73152ee4889ce9649d81967a764abfe51f2540140df506f", "ja": "子ども達に会いに行くのは、確かに大変そうだけど。\nだったら、来てもらえばいいんだ。", "zh": "要去见那些小朋友可能不容易。\n既然如此，那请他们来就好了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "e18acbfacbacf11928d77b545588fecc094d20c26a1f639cd895d5ac4c7b6879", "ja": "……みんなのいる、劇場に！", "zh": "……邀请他们，到你们大家都在的剧场来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "e310a2e46ec7d0a7af4339f8882f3fcdc5b2622e745cc6b32e42defb4c88a949", "ja": "わぁ……！　いいのかい、{$P$}？\nあの子達を、劇場に呼んでも……！", "zh": "哇……！可以吗，{$P$}？\n我们可以邀请那些小朋友来剧场吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "719dbc9a54d6228890fc9c5cdce938d6f5c4bfba0017b0704a78325ad4e7b3da", "ja": "もちろん！　せっかく出来た友達なんだ。\n招待するのは、普通のことだよ。", "zh": "那当然！难得交到朋友，\n邀请他们来玩，是很正常的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "40b963fb4ab11f835454386b5a5d1ad2aade986c30273eaffc1768c2e3790c43", "ja": "やったー！\nそしたら、またみんなでいーっぱい遊べるね！", "zh": "太棒了！\n那大家就可以再一起玩个过瘾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "9bb491fa8a626a888633461e892c70d6a6a358173ff2ed52e305315dda55b839", "ja": "みんなに見てもらうためにも、これからの\nレッスン、がんばらなくちゃいけませんね！", "zh": "为了表演给他们看，\n我们今后也得要努力练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1030_024ann", "source_sha256": "12a144335b72f7c3190efd060ad3e84f4ae6a1af15e22c657fa61f25c117223c", "ja": "ステージのあとは、また……\n一緒にゲーム、しても……いい？", "zh": "表演完以后……\n还可以再一起玩游戏……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "171fe068f60a3f914bfea4c8bf72bf19f90468b389948ca216e7de4bad9918ca", "ja": "ああ、なんなら他のメンバーと一緒でもいいぞ！", "zh": "当然，其他成员要来一起玩也可以喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1032_se", "source_sha256": "e851f92c8a1888de77030bdbedd51bc01a85125ce5dfc021ea85c6dc3d3bf5ec", "ja": "（がやがやがや……）", "zh": "（唧唧喳喳……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1033_p", "source_sha256": "d60242692f4e0ca36c250b7e43da6100c8b10366dd8da386fc4261ba398e8a20", "ja": "お、噂をすれば……", "zh": "哦，才刚提到，他们就来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1034_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "d59f2882d9804ec8944de8a917570a2d67ad8c92944b9e19780afef3097c0cbe", "ja": "こんにちはー！", "zh": "你们好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0078_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_06_1035_022ser", "source_sha256": "5ad6c21423d8aaee0a25e835fe9164387f57b6d409c15550ebd4f0e352fc0337", "ja": "えへへ、みんなこんにちは！", "zh": "嘿嘿，你们大家好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
